<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hoyts plans A$95 mln rights issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hoyts plans A$95 mln rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoyts Cinemas Ltd said on Wednesday it plans to raise A$95 million through a one-for-six rights issue with each new share issued at A$2.40.</p>
<p>The funds would be used to reduced bank borrowings, Hoyts said.</p>
